# 3️⃣ Queue Terminology

### Front

The first element.

```
Front

↓

10 20 30
```

---

### Rear

The last element.

```
10 20 30

        ↑

      Rear
```

---

# 4️⃣ Basic Queue Operations

---

## Enqueue

Insert an element at the Rear.

```
Enqueue(50)
```

Before

```
10 20 30
```

After

```
10 20 30 50
```

---

## Dequeue

Remove an element from the Front.

Before

```
10 20 30
```

After

```
20 30
```

---

## Front()

Returns the first element.

```
Queue

10 20 30

Front = 10
```

---

## Rear()

Returns the last element.

```
Queue

10 20 30

Rear = 30
```

---

## isEmpty()

Returns

```
True

or

False
```

---

## Size()

Returns total number of elements.

