# 5️⃣ Queue Representation

Queues can be implemented using:

---

### Array

```
Front                     Rear

↓

10 20 30 40

               ↑
```

---

### Linked List

```
Front

↓

10 → 20 → 30 → 40

                ↑

              Rear
```

---

# 6️⃣ Queue Operations Flow

### Enqueue

```
Insert

↓

Rear moves forward
```

---

### Dequeue

```
Remove

↓

Front moves forward
```

---

# 7️⃣ Overflow & Underflow

### Overflow

Occurs when trying to insert into a full queue.

```
Queue Full

Cannot Enqueue
```

---

### Underflow

Occurs when trying to remove from an empty queue.

```
Queue Empty

Cannot Dequeue
```

