# 9️⃣ Advantages

✅ Follows FIFO order

✅ Efficient insertion and deletion

✅ Useful in scheduling

✅ Easy to implement

---

# 🔟 Disadvantages

❌ No random access

❌ Fixed-size array implementation may overflow

❌ Front space may be wasted in a simple array implementation

